+ * through the RAW descriptor instead: main_switch.cpp's redirect_stdio_to_sd()
+ * rebinds fd 1 itself, which is process-wide, so every thread shares the exact
+ * same fd/devoptab state however its own stdout FILE* was initialized.
+ *
